# The contract package

Source: `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `docs/core-draft.md`, `docs/canonical.md` of this repo.

1. Single source: `src/v04.ts` (types, enums, required lists) -> `scripts/schemas-v04.ts` -> `schemas/` and `public/`
   (`bun run gen`). Strict keys in `src/validate-v04.ts`. Never hand-edit generated schemas.
2. The core is closed: no platform fields. Extend by a new `kind` + manifest, field rules (`fastygo.codex/*`),
   adapters outside the core (`fromX` / `toX` with a sidecar, real-data round trip), translations as records.
3. Digests are JCS (RFC 8785) + SHA-256 under the profiles `codex-entry/v1`, `codex-manifest/v2`, `codex-term/v1`,
   `codex-settings/v1` (`src/canonical.ts`, vectors in `fixtures/vectors`). Changing a profile changes vectors.
4. Public surface and semver: README "Public API and semver"; every change goes to `CHANGELOG.md`, breaking ones
   under "Breaking". Issue codes are API; keep README, registry and validator in sync (`test/agreement.test.ts`).
5. Done = `bun run check` green (typecheck + `bun test` + self-test + build). Never `npm publish` from an agent.
